Description: REST HTTP API for SMS Server Tools 3
 Sends and reads SMS through the spool directories of smsd (SMS Server
 Tools 3) over a small JSON REST API with HTTP basic authentication.
 .
 A DEMO mode accepts and logs messages without handing them to smsd.
